	(text "CARRIER STRIPS: J112 = carrier J12, J113 = J13 (2 x 1x12 2.54 mm pin strips,\nsoldered through both boards; the strips are in the carrier BOM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3e7794be-2723-57ee-8112-e7152b8cb947")
	)
	(text "PCM3168A TDM at 48 kHz (codec = clock master, or slave on the clock link; BCK 12.288 MHz).\nI2S3 slave RX: PB3 CK, PA15 WS, PB5 SD <- DOUT1 (ADC 1-6). I2S2 slave TX: PB13 CK, PB12 WS, PB15 SD -> R110 33R -> DIN1 (DAC 1-8).\nPB3/PB13 share BCK and PA15/PB12 share LRCK (tied on this board).\nI2S is rated 8 MHz max (DS V3.9): SPI-slave fallback RX PB5 (SPI3_MOSI), TX PB14 (SPI2_MISO, tied to PB15).\nI2C2: PB10/PB11 (codec 0x44, pull-ups R108/R109). PC0 codec RST. Pots: PC1 = ADC_IN11 (74HC4067 COM), PC2/PC3/PA0/PA1 = S0-S3.\nClock link: PA2 LINK_N (low = CLK IN connected = clock slave, clocks switched on the carrier).\nPA8 NORM_PROBE (jack-normal probe). PA10 = USART1_RX <- MIDI_RX (carrier MIDI IN jack, 31250 baud, not inverted) -> USB-MIDI."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ba616afa-848d-528b-ac00-644306806f7e")
	)
	(text "USB-C (vertical, through the panel): data only, VBUS sensed on PC11 (no power drawn).\nD+/D- -> USBLC6-2SC6 -> PB7/PB6 = USBHS_DP/DM (also the ROM bootloader port)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c5629890-9e84-59da-ad12-56cebeb9286d")
	)
	(text "BOOT/RESET buttons and the SWD header are on the carrier (B side).\nHold BOOT, press RESET: ROM bootloader on the USB-C (wchisp / WCHISPTool)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.36 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cbb2bc06-229c-5f58-834e-fd15bb04c330")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR MULTI-MIX - MCU board, S4. CH32V307RCT6, USB 2.0 High-Speed (UAC2 48 kHz / 24-bit, 6 in / 8 out, + USB-MIDI). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e57cd55c-605c-59c4-987d-81aeb8231f44")
	)
